  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Communication and visibility of EU-Namibia Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Objectives of the service contract:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To design and implementation of strategic communication actions, including public campaigns, to raise awareness, understanding and support for the EU and its policies and initiatives abroad, including the Global Gateway and Team Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Organise Economic Diplomacy activities, including on the Economic Partnership Agreement and in complimentarity with Regional Programming&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop long-term initiatives with key audiences and stakeholders, to build trust and mutual understanding about the EU and its partnership with third countries.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
